<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Holy Priest Healer in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Holy Priest Healer Pre-Raid</h2>
<i>Healer gearing always heavily depends on playstyle, situation and raid environment so treat the BiS list below as a guideline rather than a gospel.</i>
<br/>
<br/>
