<img alt="Heavenly Breeze" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_healer_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavenly Breeze</span></a></td>
<td>1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
