<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-holy-priest-healer">Back for Holy Priest Healer</h4>Cloak options are a little bare bones so if you're starting out you might prioritize <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77096/woundlicker-cover">
<img alt="Woundlicker Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woundlicker Cover</span></a> as your first <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> purchase. You'll use it for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a>
