<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-holy-priest-healer">Hands for Holy Priest Healer</h4>If you're planning on raiding then Hands are already going to be a slot you don't wear tier in. That can make <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77157/the-hands-of-gilly">
<img alt="The Hands of Gilly" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Hands of Gilly</span></a> more appealing as a way to spend your [currently=396] since you can get your tier bonuses in other slots and you won't replace them until you start getting loot off the last two bosses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>. Blacksmiths can add an extra socket to the Gloves slot.<div class="pad"></div>
