<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-holy-priest-healer">Waist for Holy Priest Healer</h4>Waist is another choice between a more accessible <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78398/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
<img alt="Cord of the Slain Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Slain Champion</span></a> and a more powerful <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77187/vestals-irrepressible-girdle">
<img alt="Vestal's Irrepressible Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestal's Irrepressible Girdle</span></a>. You're likely to start with the former before eventually upgrading to the latter.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="Nitro Boosts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>
