<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-holy-priest-healer">Feet for Holy Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69953/endless-dream-walkers">
<img alt="Endless Dream Walkers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Endless Dream Walkers</span></a> are a fairly high item level crafted option, though if you're not swimming in gold it might be easier to just invest in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78457/janglespur-jackboots">
<img alt="Janglespur Jackboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Janglespur Jackboots</span></a> and then eventually upgrade them to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77177/splinterfoot-sandals">
<img alt="Splinterfoot Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splinterfoot Sandals</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74199/enchant-boots-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Haste</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
