<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Holy Priest Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-holy-priest-healer">Neck for Holy Priest Healer</h4>Take advantage of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71214/firemind-pendant">
<img alt="Firemind Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firemind Pendant</span></a> being available for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> and grab it early to save your other currencies, then when you're flush with them a few weeks into your gear progression, grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78382/petrified-fungal-heart">
<img alt="Petrified Fungal Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Fungal Heart</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77089/threadlinked-chain">
<img alt="Threadlinked Chain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Threadlinked Chain</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
