<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-holy-priest-healer">Trinkets for Holy Priest Healer</h4>You'll want to immediately seek out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77976/heart-of-unliving">
<img alt="Heart of Unliving" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_qirajicrystal_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Unliving</span></a> since it's our best trinket by a decent margin. You might even spend your very first <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> on it. Your second slot is much more flexible but I'd recommend <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77981/windward-heart">
<img alt="Windward Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_crystal_air.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windward Heart</span></a> for most scenarios. The two <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> trinkets are not very good even though they are higher item level. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Note:</b> <i>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77975/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> is not listed on the chart below because it's not a very good Holy Priest trinket. It's very good for Discipline Priest though so if you play both specs then you should consider buying it.</i>
