<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Holy Priest Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staves-for-holy-priest-healer">Staves for Holy Priest Healer</h4>While we'll talk through some Staff options, you should know that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78485/maw-of-the-dragonlord">
<img alt="Maw of the Dragonlord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maw of the Dragonlord</span></a> is a god-tier 1 handed weapon that you will never take off once you've bought it. The options below are therefore very limited since the window in which you'd wear a Staff is very small.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
